  message: "Merged 8f559a33bc (bundle). julia const_statement branch now emits one const per bound name via _julia_assignment_target_names (multi-name const a,b=1,2 and typed const K::Int=3 went 0→N symbols), module-qualified id + bare name, with a function-preferring symbol_by_name tie-break so a const does not clobber a same-named function in resolution (clobber test verified as a valid RED). lang-common 100%."  # f7f5
